<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><%- include("partials/head", {title:"Claim your pass"}) %></head><body><main class="shell narrow"><a class="back" href="/">← THE DAILY DRIP</a><div class="eyebrow">YOUR EXCLUSIVE INVITATION</div><h1>Make it<br>yours.</h1><p class="muted">Enter your details to receive your personal complimentary pass.</p><% if (error) { %><div class="alert"><%= error %></div><% } %><form method="post" action="/claim"><label>Your name</label><input name="name" autocomplete="name" maxlength="80" required placeholder="Full name"><label>Mobile number</label><input name="phone" inputmode="tel" autocomplete="tel" required minlength="10" placeholder="10-digit mobile number"><button class="button full" type="submit">Create my pass</button></form><p class="tiny">One pass per mobile number. By continuing, you agree that the cafe may use these details to manage your pass.</p></main></body></html>